      "writtenOn": "2020-12-01T09:36:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe not for this CL.\nFrom the description this is very similar to mixInCapabilities.\nDo we want to refactor them?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6354,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 6354,
